### Home
GET http://localhost:1206


### Register User
POST http://localhost:1206/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ashish",
  "email": "ashish@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}


### Login User
POST http://localhost:1206/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ashish@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}


### Create Bookmark
POST http://localhost:1206/api/bookmarks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "OpenAI",
  "url": "https://openai.com",
  "tags": ["ai", "tools"],
  "category": "Development",
  "isFavorite": true
}


### Get My Bookmarks
GET http://localhost:1206/api/bookmarks


### Get Single Bookmark
GET http://localhost:1206/api/bookmarks/69c7b2833e5ba7f519ad77bd


### Update Bookmark
PUT http://localhost:1206/api/bookmarks/69c7b2833e5ba7f519ad77bd
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "OpenAI Platform",
  "tags": ["ai", "api", "tools"],
  "category": "Tech",
  "isFavorite": false
}


### Delete Bookmark
DELETE http://localhost:1206/api/bookmarks/69c7b2833e5ba7f519ad77bd


### Logout User
POST http://localhost:1206/api/auth/logout